  "execution": "Strictly serial; no overlap with any other native benchmark, structured collection or compilation",
  "interpretation_order": [
    "Compare each normal arm PMU-off versus PMU-on whole-batch times to expose counter-boundary disturbance",
    "Compare normal versus split under matched PMU-on conditions to expose copied-driver/control overhead",
    "Compare split versus stages to expose per-stage clock and record-layout disturbance",
    "Only then interpret stage prefix/tail differences and whole-batch instructions/cycles; never claim unbiased attribution of original 1% timing change"
